  },
  "StockRole": "Superheavy OmniMech",
  "YangsThoughts": "When the Capellan Confederation needed a new 'Mech to export, House Liao decided the easiest and cheapest way was to \"acquire\" the design of the Sunder OmniMech from a certain neighbor Inner Sphere state. To prevent any accusations about using their design without permissions, House Liao scientists then decided to simply upscale the design and make it a superheavy. This is how the 165 ton Wannu OmniMech was born, which then was exported to both the Lyrans and the Suns. Some even found their way back to the Draconis Combine, although House Kurita did refuse to buy any directly for some reason.",
